window.products.push({"id":547020,"name":"Superior Chef Stainless Steel Serrated Apple Corer By Peppermate, Durable Corer for Apples and Pears","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p1nsCuMVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Ever get stuck trying to make the perfect apple ring? It could be for apple pie, an apple scone or apple fritters? That is where the Superior Chef Serrated Apple Corer comes in. Made of high quality stainless steel and a serrated tip, this tool will have your removing the apple core with ease.Features:- Stainless Steel Construction with a Serrated Edge- Soft Yet Durable Handle with Built In Eyelet- Dishwasher SafeHow do you like them apples? Superior Chef by Peppermate is a series of high quality kitchen tools meant to add some function to the modern kitchen. Each product was hand selected, tested, cleaned, tested again and finally approved for this 2017 line. The superior chef is an ideal choice for gourmet cooking at home.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p1nsCuMVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PepperMate","source_asin":"B0194FZB82","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547020","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0194FZB82","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0194FZB82","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
