window.products.push({"id":547086,"name":"Rosy Rings Forest Round Botanical Candle 120 Hour Burn Time - Notes of Clary Sage, Creamy Sandal, White Musk Aromatherapy Candles, Woodsy Scent Aroma ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":60.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ccxPbgA6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Create an idyllic space where fresh greenery is etched into memory with the scent of a walk in the forest. Notes of red cedar, scotch pine, clary sage, creamy sandal and white musk come together to create the dreamy sensation of being surrounded by trees and misty air. Bring a deep, woodsy fragrance to your home with the forest candle. It features a blend of essential oils and natural botanicals that fill your space with the smell of falling leaves and wet fir needles underfoot. Our forest candle captures what it feels like to wander down a misty woodland path and experience the gentle crunch of leaves, the rich earthiness of moss, the snap of fir needles underfoot. A unique blend of our proprietary wax and all-natural scents creates a truly enchanting sensory experience. Inspired by walking through forest and the experience of being within nature. The ambiance is always breathtaking with the forest scented candle. Immerse yourself in this botanical-inspired candle, where a winding forest path brings you to the edge of a misty lake. With every botanical element placed carefully by hand, this candle fills your space with light and fragrant notes of eucalyptus, fir needle and pine. The outdoors come inside with a modern take on a forest walk. Subtle eucalyptus scent exudes from birch twigs, fir needles and cedarwood, and adds a sophisticated touch to this botanical candle. This candle measures 5.5\" in height and has a generous burn time of 120 hours. Bring a spectacular botanical bouquet into your home with the forest candle. With every element placed, this hand-crafted soy candle is perfect for filling your space with fragrance and illuminating botanical elements. This candle is earthy and fresh, with notes of cedarwood and pine. The soothing aroma of the woods captured in a candle. Enveloping your space with woodland fragrance, this candle features an expert blend of notes including red cedar, white musk and pine. Take a nature walk without leaving home. As you light the forest candle, the winding path of your journey will be illuminated with rich woodsy scents.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ccxPbgA6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rosy Rings","source_asin":"B0BX15DZTZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547086","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BX15DZTZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BX15DZTZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
