window.products.push({"id":547135,"name":"nambe Aiden 5-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set | 18/10 Mirror Stainless Steel Silverware Cutlery Set | Designed for Home Kitchens, Hotel, or Restaur","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":48.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tz1wGoPOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Handsome and optimistic, aidan's modern tailoring makes it a perfect companion for almost any dinnerware. True to designer Lou henry's philosophy, the pattern is all about the beauty of pure form. Spearing bites of tender filet with the elegant fork tines and spooning up your favorite steel-cut oatmeal become everyday acts of quiet enjoyment. Forged of 18/10 stainless steel in a pleasing heft and balance, the flatware stays brightly polished even after repeated dishwasher cleaning. Amazon.com Designed for Nambé by New York-based designer Lou Henry, Aidan flatware brings to life the contemporary aesthetic that form, not ornamentation, is what is truly beautiful. Aidan pieces are pleasingly formed, featuring slender, round handles that taper to a blunt point and feel nicely balanced in the hand. The spoon bowls are sleek oversized ovals, the fork tines elegantly long, and the knife blade plain and straightforward. This is a flatware pattern that looks comfortable with almost any dinnerware pattern. Nambé forges the flatware from 18/10 stainless steel and finishes it with a mirror shine that is dishwasher-safe. This five-piece place setting consists of a dinner knife, dinner fork, salad fork, soup spoon, and teaspoon. Nambé was founded in 1951 in a village of the same name in scenic northern New Mexico. From the beginning, the company has focused on hand-producing high-quality, functional items such as metal bowls and trays with great attention to timeless, modern design. Stainless steel, porcelain, and crystal pieces now join Nambé's signature metal-alloy lines, all of which are flawlessly crafted and exceptional as gifts. Nambé has won numerous design awards, has been shown in or recognized by nearly two dozen museums worldwide, and is part of the permanent collections of many prestigious institutions. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 1 place setting. The place setting consists of: dinner knife; dinner fork; salad fork; soup spoon; teaspoon. 5 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61tz1wGoPOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"nambe","source_asin":"B000VXVCCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547135","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000VXVCCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000VXVCCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
