window.products.push({"id":547162,"name":"MTOUOCK Bathroom Rugs, 16\"x24\" Shaggy & Soft Chenille Mix Microfiber Bath Mat for Bathroom, Excellent Absorbent Bathroom Mat, Machine Washable Bath Ru","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718BI4ddIUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUE DESIGN: MTOUOCK use unique fiber-locking technique, say goodbye to horrible fibre-dropping! This bath mat is composed of 3 layers: fabric layer, middle sponge layer and bottom anti-skid layer. The fabric layer could made of chenille & microfiber that both could bring you clound-feeling of softness, the middle layer provides cushioned support against cold and hard floors to help improve circulation. DURABLE & NON-SLIP BACKING: We use the more expensive TPR backing material (not PVC or glue) which can withstand from hundreds of washing, won't fall apart. Place rug on clean dry smooth floor only, ensure the bottom of the bathroom mat is dry and clean before use, water or dust under rug can cause slipping. ULTRA ABSORBENT: The chenille mix microfiber bath rug is much more absorbent than cotton bath rugs. High-pile helps save your floors from dripping water while you're stepping out of the bath, shower, spa, or getting ready by the sink. Due to the high-plie of microfiber which may not dry quickly, please sun-cure it on balcony frequently. MACHINE WASHABLE & NO SHEDDING: Our bath mats is easy to clean; simply toss it into the washing machine with detergent on the gentle cycle and let air dry. With premium fiber locking technology, every fiber is firmly attached onto the backing so that the bathroom rug will not shed and will anti-slip. The Bathroom Mats are tested to ensure that they can withstand frequent machine washings and still maintain shape. WIDELY USE & CUSTOMER CARE: MTOUOCK bathroom rugs are widely used in the bedroom, bathroom, living room, mud room, entryways, hotels, feet-spa club, and by bathtub and sink. If you are not are satisfied with our product, please do not hesitate contacting us. We will always give you a reasonable solution.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718BI4ddIUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MTOUOCK","source_asin":"B092MBLRPR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547162","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092MBLRPR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092MBLRPR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":547163,"name":"The Oak of Flagey by Gustave Courbet, 18x24-Inch Canvas Wall Art","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GLIRLAtrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"This ready to hang, gallery-wrapped art piece features an oak tree. Best known as an innovator in Realism, Courbet was a painter of figurative compositions, landscaped and seascapes. He also worked with social issues, and addressed peasantry and the grave working conditions of the porr. His work belonged neither to the predominant Romantic nor Neoclassical schools. Rather, Courbet believed the Realist artist's missions was the pursuit of truth, which would help erase social contradictions and imbalances. Giclee (jee-clay) is an advanced printmaking process for creating high quality fine art reproductions. The attainable excellence that Giclee printmaking affords makes the reproduction virtually indistinguishable from the original piece. The result is wide acceptance of Giclee by galleries, museums, and private collectors. Gallery wrap is a method of stretching an artist's canvas so that the canvas wraps around the sides and is secured a hidden, wooden frame. This method of stretching and preparing a canvas allows for a frameless presentation of the finished painting.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71GLIRLAtrL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trademark Fine Art","source_asin":"B00BM8YRIA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BM8YRIA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BM8YRIA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
