window.products.push({"id":547170,"name":"Parve Green Slotted Turner Spatula - Heavy Duty Silicone Kitchen Utensil for Cooking and Baking - Ergonomic Handle and Comfortable Grip - Color Coded ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MFfhaifrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep your kitchen kosher while using the highest quality cookware with The Kosher Cook ! Our color coded kitchen utensils are extremely reliable, durable, and easy to use so you can get any cooking job finished with absolute simplicity. The colors and labels let you know at a glance if it is meat, dairy or parve. PRODUCTS INCLUDE: The Kosher Cook’s Spring Collection consists of a comprehensive line of color coded kitchen tools and utensils which includes: Pasta Spoons Prep Whisks Turners Slotted Turners Spoons Slotted Spoons Knife Sharpener Rolling Pin Winged Corkscrew Waiter’s Corkscrew Wine Stoppers Stainless Steel Wash Cups Kitchen Scissors Easy-Grip Scourer Shabbos Scouring Pad Mesh Sink Strainers Flex Lighters HIGH QUALITY Each product is made with food grade and safe materials and designed to be long lasting. KEEPING IT KOSHER The Kosher Cook provides a wide array of tools to help separate milchig, fleishig and parev. Color coded utensils and tools along with labels and stickers allow you to see at a glance if the item is dairy, meat or pareve. Whether you are new to keeping kashrut or a seasoned veteran looking to make life easier, the Kosher Cook has the tools to keep the highest standards of kosher cooking. ABOUT THE KOSHER COOK Part of the Ner Mitzvah family, The Kosher Cook is another way we to help you keep Jewish traditions and laws. Family-operated since the 1940’s, Ner Mitzvah is an expert maker of household products and the premier source for traditional and gift Judaica items. Count on Ner Mitzvah for all Shabbat, Chanukah and Jewish Holiday needs.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81MFfhaifrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Kosher Cook","source_asin":"B07CX9X9QC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547170","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CX9X9QC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CX9X9QC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":547171,"name":"HOME-X Plastic Butterfly-Themed Chip Clips, Food Bag Storage Clip, Set of 8, Multiple Colors, 3” L x 3” W x 2” H","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OovBawpSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"When you haven't finished a bag of your favorite snacks, there's no need to waste them by throwing them away. Use these bag clips to keep your food tasting fresh instead! Just fold over the top of the bag and then clamp a butterfly clip on the top. The flat edge will help keep the fold intact and the air sealed tight so you can prolong the shelf life of your snacks. Because of the clips' durable grip, they won't come loose or slip. Still, some bags come in bulk and may need extra sealing. That's why we offer a large set of bag clips. This package comes with 8 cute bag clips in the shape of butterflies. The spring-themed clips come in 8 different colors: blue, red, green, yellow, clear, orange, yellow-green, and purple. These colorful clips will make a great addition to your kitchen accessories and gadgets. Made from durable plastic and strong springs, the clips are designed for long-term use and can even go in the fridge. Take them with you while camping to keep your foods fresh without a regular pantry. The clips are effective at keeping various foods fresh—bread, chips, frozen vegetables, pretzels, and more. Plus, they are small enough to store easily when not in use. If you're in a pinch, you can also use these clips as clothespins. We know that you'll love these small butterfly clips, and so will your friends and family members! Give them a set of these clips for birthdays, Christmas, housewarming parties, bridal showers, weddings, or other special occasions. Order a set of these butterfly clips today, and don't worry about stale snacks again!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81OovBawpSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Home-X","source_asin":"B084G92RYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547171","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B084G92RYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B084G92RYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
