window.products.push({"id":547181,"name":"Trolley Bags - Reusable Eco Friendly Shopping Bags to Easily and Safely Bag your Groceries From Your Cart. Sized for Standard American Grocery Carts. ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RUi42kcgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The 4 color coded bags simply fan out and spread across the top of any supermarket trolley, allowing you to pack the way you want. Use the big bag at one end for the bulkier, lighter items and smaller, heavier items in the small bag at the front. Simply detach each bag and place into the trunk of the car for the trip back home to unpack. Excellent to get for your wife, girlfriend, mother, daughter, granddaughter or grandmother. Pastel Color DESIGNED TO FIT: Trolley Bags were designed with the American grocery shopper in mind. The Vibe Original are the vibrant color option that fit the standard American Grocery cart found at stores such as Kroger, Walmart, Albertsons, Winn Dixie, etc and Do you part to help the planet and show all of your neighbors that you care. Eliminate all of the earth damaging and animal hurting plastic bags and tree killing paper bags. Use Trolley Bags reusable grocery bags to bag your groceries and do you part to make the planet a better place for your kids. SMART DESIGN: Trolley Bags were designed with shopper’s ease in mind. They spread out perfectly when you are ready to use them. They attached via velcro for easy management and then easily separate to load into your car. Once you are finished you just fold them up and roll them up for easy storage DURABLE: Made of the highest quality materials. Double stitched and high grade materials. Avoid all of the cheap knock offs and low end copies. Only the Trolley Bags are the original grocery packing solution. Designed to be used for many years. Machine washable. AVOID COUNTERFEITS: Ignore all of the cheap Chinese knock-offs that were made with the cheapest material and design possible. There is a reason that all of the competitors use Trolley Bags in their listing. We are the original and uphold the highest product standards. To prove we are better than the counterfeits we offer a 100 percent Full Refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81RUi42kcgL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trolley Bags","source_asin":"B06W9GCW3N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547181","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B06W9GCW3N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B06W9GCW3N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":547182,"name":"Let’s Make Memories Personalized Love You Forever Glass Heart Ornament - Keepsake Christmas Ornament - Holiday Décor - Couples Ornament - Customize Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612y5CO4xkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"UNIQUELY PERSONALIZED: Memorialize being in love during the holiday season! Customize your ornament with any 2-line message up to 18 characters each and any numeric date/year. CHRISTMAS IS A TIME FOR LOVE: This special keepsake ornament for couples is an excellent addition to any Christmas tree. It presents a unique opportunity to celebrate your infinite bond. PREMIUM QUALITY: Made of glass, this beautifully crafted personalized ornament measures 3.25\"x3.5\". It's presented in a velvet drawstring bag, ready for gift-giving and protective storage. Imported for final manufacture locally. AN ENCHANTING GIFT: Christmas is time to cherish those near and dear. This ornament—an exceptional gift for any couple—is sure to have a special place on their tree and in their hearts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612y5CO4xkL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Let's Make Memories","source_asin":"B09LRGZY61","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547182","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09LRGZY61","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09LRGZY61","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
