window.products.push({"id":547212,"name":"sheetsnthings 8pcs Full Size Bed in a Bag Embroidered Amalia Gold & White Duvet Set Including Cotton 3pcs Duvet Cover Set+ 4pcs Full Sheet Set+ 1pc Fu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616rPrYHwXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"8PC ALL SEASONS COZY BEDDING SET- This Lovely Bed in a Bag is What You Need to Enjoy Your Sleep All Night Long. You Will Receive 3 Packages in One Box (Package #1 has a 3pc Duvet Cover Set), (Package #2 has a 4pc Sheets Set) and (Package #3 has 1pc White Down Alternative Comforter) This is Your Go To Bedding if You are Looking to Upgrade Your Bedroom's Decor! FLUFFY WHITE DOWN ALTERNATIVE COMFORTER- This Set Includes a Full/Queen Size All Seasons White Down Alternative Comforter that Measures 90-Inches Wide x 90-Inches Long with 50 Ounces Polyester Fill. The Box Stitched Duvet Insert has 4 Corner Ties to Keep Comforter in it's Place when Used with a Duvet Cover EYE CATCHING EMBROIDERED DUVET COVER SET- This Set Also Includes an Elegant Full/Queen Size 3-Piece Duvet Cover Set made of 100% Cotton Woven with Superior Single-Ply Yarn that Measures One Duvet Cover 90-Inches Wide x 92-Inches Long and Two Pillow Shams 20-Inches Wide x 26-Inches Long each. The Duvet Cover has Hidden Button Closure By Footer for a Proper Fit SOFT BED SHEETS ARE INCLUDED- To Complete Your Bedding Set, We Included 100% Cotton-300TC (Full) 4-Piece Sheets Set that Measures One Flat Sheet 80\"W x 94\"L, One Fitted Sheet 54\"W x 76\"L, Two Pillowcases 20\"W x 30\"L each (Sheets will be Solid or Striped, based on availability- Email us to Request a Specific Pattern/Color) CARE INSTRUCTIONS- The Down Alternative Comforter: Dry Clean. Duvet Cover Set and Bed Sheets: Machine Wash in Cold Water on Delicate Cycle with Mild Detergent- No Bleach. Dry on Low Settings. We Recommend to Put Your Linens on Your Bed Set Right After Pulling Them Out of the Dryer. Also, Wash-Dry Sheets with Similar Linens, Don't Wash-Dry with Clothing that Have Metals or Rough Material Like Zippers","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616rPrYHwXL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sheetsnthings","source_asin":"B09KN1GKJX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547212","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09KN1GKJX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09KN1GKJX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
