window.products.push({"id":547345,"name":"Urban Apothecary Oudh Geranium Luxury Diffuser and Refill with Reeds, 2 x 200 ml","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kc2i9pNvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Take a trip to the Middle East through this musky memory of a magical place with rich mysterious vibes. Oudh Geranium’s soulful trail taps easily into the senses, promoting a meditative mood. In our contemporary apothecary we respect this ancient ingredient; it brings inner peace to this fragrance, a concept that never gets old! This majestic and rich Oudh scented candle is pure luxury. Oudh is one of the most highly valued ingredients of the perfumer’s palette. This rare and resinous wood from a tropical tree is loved for its smoky and aromatic woody character. In this oriental composition, the unique scent of oudh is freshened with geranium’s rosy tones and deepened with smooth notes of amber, vetiver, patchouli and praline.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71kc2i9pNvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Urban Apothecary London","source_asin":"B07YN8WQFG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547345","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YN8WQFG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YN8WQFG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
