window.products.push({"id":547481,"name":"Spice Rack Organizer for Cabinets or Wall Mounts. Seasoning Organizer Set of 4 Hanging Racks, Space Saving for Kitchen Cabinet, Cupboard or Pantry Doo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4170JMWpNHL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description No more digging in cabinets looking for your desired spices!The wall mounted spice racks from Better Chance will make organization easy in your kitchen, bathroom, craft room, garage or any place you need to get organized at home. The cabinet spice racks offer ample space (depth: 2.3 in ; width 3.5 in; length: 11.2 in) for up to 24 jars of all regular-sized spice jars and bottles. DIY as you like – YOU decide: All cabinet rack organizers or just one spice storage rack? Four separate racks for spices make it possible.How much space between the racks? Hang them as close together or far apart as you need them. Using them as over stove spice rack, inside the cabinet, on the closet door or as wall mounted rack in the pantry? Choose what works best for you or use each spice cupboard organizer for a different purpose! Mounting the hanging shelf for spice jars is done in no time. The hanging hardware is included and with the two different sized screws (approx. 0.5 in and 1 in in length) you have a reliable tool to install the spice rack anywhere. A secure fit and clever design makes sure that rattling when opening the cabinet will be at a minimum.Built to last and to shine: The wall mounted spice organizer combine durable, premium quality materials with a stylish, elegant look. The chrome finish of the seasoning organizer fits nicely in any kitchen decor.Finding things in your pantries will be a piece of cake with the space-saving mountable spice rack. Add it to your cart now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/4170JMWpNHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Better Chance","source_asin":"B083SKSPM6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547481","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083SKSPM6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083SKSPM6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":547482,"name":"Miceshu Sous Vide Cooker Machine, Kitchen Appliances Thermal Immersion Circulator Ultra-quiet Stainless Steel Cooker Control Temperature and Timer wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HzhFKCH5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Precision Temperature and Timer】Food slowly cooks at precise low temperatures over a long period of time (10min-72h) to achieve succulent, superb tasting meals. Easy to read display, touch screen digital controls, just operate this Cooker with a simple touch. lightweight stainless steel with a rubber coating on the handle. 【Ultra-Quiet & 3D Circultion Heating Tech】Temperature range and accuracy are 68°F～194°F (20ºC~90ºC ) of this sous vide machine， The motor propeller circulates water around the pot and gets your food cooked evenly, and most of all, it keeps the food fresh and nutritious. Chicken, fish, vegetables, eggs, beef, lamb, pork, and more are all ideal candidates for sous vide circulation. 【Consistent Cooking】Vitamins, minerals, and juices are retained within the food and natural flavors are intensified. Precision cooking enables you to produce results that are impossible to achieve through any other cooking method. No Dry edges and no rare centers. Juices and flavors don't escape, During the cooking process, you can go jogging without worrying burnt, because the sous vide cookers stop automatically. 【Creates Quality Dishes】Slim sous vide immersion circulator prepares high end restaurant quality dishes at home, turning home cooks into gourmet chefs, As Sous Vide cooking requires foods and meats to be sealed individually, yet cooked at the same time; it is perfect for families and entertaining when there are people with varied tastes and nutritional requirements. 【Protection and Temperature Alarm】Auto-off when water is below the min water line or above the max water line for safe use. Also will alarm you when temp reaches target setting value. The stainless steel is easy to clean. This cooker is constructed with BPA-free stainless steel, do no harm to health.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HzhFKCH5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MICESHU","source_asin":"B08P1S3G2Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547482","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P1S3G2Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P1S3G2Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
