window.products.push({"id":547555,"name":"Ne'Qwa Art 7211117 There’s Snow One Like You Hand-Painted Blown Glass Ornament, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eFuLZWEHL._AC_.jpg","description":"When temperatures fall and the nearby pond freezes through, it is time to find some ice skates and head out for winter fun! Side by side, a snowman couple shares a sunny winter afternoon on the ice. They look extra adorable in their colorful and cozy coats and accessories. Inspired by the whimsical artwork of Tricia Harrison, Ne’Qwa Art artisans recreate a blissful snowman scene. This memorable gift includes a Certificate of Authenticity and is beautifully packaged in a satin-lined, keepsake gift box. This delightful ornament is a perfect gift for friends, family, coworkers, teachers, or anyone who loves decorating for the holidays with snowmen. It also makes a thoughtful hostess gift, housewarming present, or couple’s first Christmas gift! An adjustable tasseled cord allows for display on a Christmas tree or a Ne’Qwa Art ornament stand. This ornament measures approximately 4”H. Petite Brilliant shape. All genuine Ne’Qwa Art ornaments and gifts are created with the ancient technique of hand-painting original art on the inside of mouth-blown glass. With meticulous attention to every detail, trained artisans use specially designed paintbrushes to re-create stunning works of original art. Make memories to treasure for a lifetime with authentic Ne’Qwa Art glass ornaments and gifts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41eFuLZWEHL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"XGATML","source_asin":"B08X3TNVVN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547555","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08X3TNVVN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08X3TNVVN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
