window.products.push({"id":547613,"name":"Christmas Shower Curtain Set for Bathroom Cute Little Cat Kitty Playing with Christmas Bells, Winter Holiday Polyester Fabric Decoration with Hooks an","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ZhygsCxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"1.Material: Our non-see-through polyester textile has no texture as cloth and cotton, but woven fabric, similar to the umbrella. You still feel comfortable when touching. Plus, it's not flimsy at all. 2.Printing: To our oil painting series, the image and colors is slightly different with online picture. The curtain is kind of blurry and pixelated if you get very close up looking because oil painting style is fuzzy. But it still looks wonderful from distance. Only one sided printing. 3.Easy to Care: - Machine washable with gentle cycle or wipe it clean with damp cloth then just re-hang. - Don't bleach and put into dryer to avoid shrinkage. - Ironing with medium-low heat setting take the wrinkles out. 4.Decoration: Backdrop for window, wall, door, photo booth, even outdoors as long as curtain is fixed. It still fit perfect. 5.Thinness: Only polyester fabric shower curtain provide the highly customized pattern however it can't give extra weight like the plastic (vinyl & PEVA) shower curtain. So some buyers may think it's so thin and light that blow-in effect happens when showering. So how to stop yours from clinging to you? Below are suggestions: Hang plastic liner inside the tub while the fabric curtain hangs outside of tub. Attach magnets or clip weights at the bottom of curtain. SIMPLEST METHOD: Just leave a little gap open on the side of the shower curtain while showering. This effectively minimize blow-in effect to stick on your body.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/618ZhygsCxL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Plauduct","source_asin":"B081J3XWWL","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547613","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B081J3XWWL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B081J3XWWL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
