window.products.push({"id":547670,"name":"HBA Framed Laundry Metal Sign Mounted on Rustic, Weathered Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gQL29Z8pL._AC_.jpg","description":"This is a unique, one-of-a-kind item (no two frames exactly alike). This is a rustic item made by hand from old barn and fence wood. Hand-made in America, these sturdy metal signs will perfectly accent any kitchen, home, or office. Each sign is created by baking enamelized ink into a tough, polyester coating on a thick steel blank. The result is amazing durability,rich color, and fine detail. Add a stunning and colorful touch to your home with these versatile and affordable wall accents. These are not like those thin, cheap tins other companies make. When you hold this sign in your hand you will definitely feel and see the difference. The frame: ----Outside dimensions of frame are 13\" x 17\" --Hand-made from rustic, recycled barn and fence wood --Every joint secured with wood glue --Edges and corners sanded smooth --Back is glued on then secured with twelve 5/8\" brads. This is a very sturdy item. --Metal sign secured with 4 rusted screws The metal sign: --The metal sign itself measures 12\" x 16\" --Glossy, full-color, enamelized image baked onto recycled, thick, 24-gauge steel --Eco-friendly process -- handmade, right here in the USA --Ships in Ploy-bag for complete protection","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51gQL29Z8pL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HBA","source_asin":"B01862H6UA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547670","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01862H6UA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01862H6UA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
