window.products.push({"id":547896,"name":"12.5\" Acacia Wood Lazy Susan Turntable with Handles, Tomoaza Kitchen Organizer Turntable with Steel Sides, 360 Degree Turntable for Countertop Cabinet","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kpMLcrxQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️【DIMENSION】➤Product size (including base): 12.5\" x 3.2\", iron frame edge height: 1.65\". The handle is added to the iron frame to make it convenient for you to move. Raised outer edges keep items in place while spinning.Bottom with 3 non-skid mat to make sure the turntable stable while spinning it.Perfect space saving for table tops, kitchen counter, dining table.This rotating lazy susan organizer tray makes items easy to reach, even when stored on upper shelves or in corner cabinets. ✔️【NATURAL, ECO-FRIENDLY SAFE】➤Made of natural solid acacia wood, eco-friendly and premium quality.The grain of Acacia is both unique and beautiful, which makes no two pieces look alike! So while your turntable not be exactly like the images, it will be beautiful and a completely food safe way to decorate your food. ✔️【360 DEGREE ROTATING】➤360° Rotatable Design provides quick access for condiments, oils, spices and more on the countertop/cabinet/pantry. You can simply rotate it to get the item you need.From any side, anything is reachable turning around and take what you need almost instantly. ✔️【BEST GIFT IDEA】➤Acacia Wood Lazy Susan is beautiful and space-saving, it is very suitable for countertop, kitchen counters, dining tables, and even outdoor dining tables, when you organize delicious food gatherings for everyone. And very suitable as a gift for those who love family storage. ✔️【QUALITY GUARANTEED】➤We really want to provide better product and service to our consumers. We will strictly control the quality of the products before they are sent out. If you are not satisfied with the lazy susuan after receiving the goods, please contact us, we will provide fast replacement or refund.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81kpMLcrxQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tomoaza","source_asin":"B0BPR74P1W","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547896","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPR74P1W","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPR74P1W","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
