window.products.push({"id":547908,"name":"Industrial Wall Mounted Pipe Shelving,Rustic Metal Floating Shelves,Steampunk Real Wood Bookcases,DIY Bookshelf Hanging Shelves,Farmhouse Kitchen Bar ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":89.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CC9qlIr6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Sturdy Structure Floating Shelves】: The pipe shelves constructed with durable SOLID WOOD planks and sturdy IRON PIPES. The pipe shelving adopts the latest technology of a one-piece structure, so it is easy to be installed on the wall correctly and firmly fixed without any wobble. Protective black matt finish preventing rust and premature wearing. 【Industrial Style Pipe Shelving】: This cool looking wall mount shelf, featured with rustic wood grain planks and industrial metal brackets, is a perfect decor for any wall space, providing a great retro-style and aesthetic appeal addition, fits well with your personal taste and interior decoration. 【Space-Saving & Versatile Wall Shelves】: 2-tier utility wall-mounted rack provides large storage space while saving your floor space. You can place your favorite books, collections, family pictures, artworks, vases, etc. and also organize your spot plants, making your stuff neat and tidy. You can always find a suitable place for the wall shelf in your living room, bedroom, office, or study room. 【Easy Assembly And Clean】: All required fittings and user manual are all included in the package. By following the detailed graphical assembly instructions and numbered parts inside the package, you can assemble the floating bookcase easily. Besides, you can clean it easily just wipe with a soft dry cloth to get rid of the dust and grime. Dimensions: Overall: 28.35'' H x 36'' W x 9.84'' D. Board Size: 36'' x 9.84'' x 0.78''. Height between Shelves: 11.22-inch. 【Don't hesitate】: Your Satisfaction is Our Goal. We are always available to provide professional customer service before and after your purchase, our professional customer service team will reply as soon as possible within 24 hours. So don't wait any longer and enjoy it right now！","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71CC9qlIr6L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DOFURNILIM","source_asin":"B09182KZLP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547908","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09182KZLP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09182KZLP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":547909,"name":"Ecolution Patented Micro-Pop Microwave Popcorn Popper with Temperature Safe Glass, 3-in-1 Lid Measures Kernels and Melts Butter, Made Without BPA, Dis","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81v+HYqpedL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A revolution in popcorn has arrived! The days of pre-packaged and unhealthy popcorn are now things of the past. Ecolution's Micro-Pop popcorn popper allows you to make fresh, delicious, and healthy popcorn with total ease. The wide mouth opening makes prepping and cleaning easy. Simply measure your fresh popcorn kernels in the lid, drop them directly into the popper, place the lid on top, and place into the microwave for 3-minutes or less. Don't use the popcorn setting. Instead, listen and push stop once pops are two seconds apart. No oils or additives are needed. For an added treat, the perforated lid can be used to melt butter directly onto the popcorn in the microwave as it pops. Within minutes you will have fluffy white popcorn ready for your movie night or afternoon snack. Micro-Pop comes in two sizes and multiple colors to match any home decor. Each popper is made without BPA and the glass is temperature safe. Clean-up is easy as this is dishwasher safe. These cool gadgets make unique gifts for the person who has everything. Also, takes up much less kitchen storage space than small appliances or traditional air popcorn poppers, which makes it great for a small apartment or dorm room. Ecolution's Micro-Pop popcorn popper is an easy, safe, and fun way to have the perfect snack at any time! USE AND CARE: Only use popcorn popper in a clean, fully functioning microwave oven with an unrestricted, rotating turntable. Microwave ovens may differ in cook time and temperature. Use fresh popcorn kernels. Please use caution when removing the popcorn pot from the microwave, we recommend using an oven mitt to remove, as it may be hot.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81v+HYqpedL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ecolution","source_asin":"B0BHMVMQNJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547909","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BHMVMQNJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BHMVMQNJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
