window.products.push({"id":547972,"name":"Homelegance Bookshelf Storage Pier, Espresso Finish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QePmuAcmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Standing as a bold statement in your living room, the Polson Collection provides the perfect platform for your media storage and display. Bookshelf storage rises from each side to flank the lower television stand. The espresso finish is contrasted by the brushed satin nickel knobs that front the ample storage drawers and doors. Scoring and use of double knobs give the illusion of additional drawer storage. X-framing that is boldly featured on the side pier bookcases lends a trendy feel to this functional media unit.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QePmuAcmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Homelegance","source_asin":"B00O0MG4VI","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00O0MG4VI","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00O0MG4VI","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":547973,"name":"2 Pack Silicone Air Fryer Liners Basket, Reusable Air Fryer Silicone Pots, 8.5 Inch Food Grade Air fryer Inserts Fits for 5QT - 8QT Air Fryer(Blue-Gre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GpjQfU4ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"AIR FRYER MUST HAVE: 2 pack reusable silicone air fryer liner insert does a good job to keep crumbs and oil splashes down. The non-stick surface prevents food from sticking and makes cleaning up a breeze. No longer have to scrub the fryer basket and tray. Make your air frying experience more convenient and enjoyable. A versatile and essential accessory for any air fryer owner. 8.5\" silicone pot fits 5qt 5.2qt 5.3qt 5.5qt 5.7qt 5.8qt 6qt 6.2qt 6.8qt 7qt airfryers etc. EASY TO CLEAN & DISHWASHER SAFE: Washable air fryer liners is so easy to use and clean. Put it on your dishwasher and had no problems. Also easy enough to clean by hand! Air fryer silicone liners save a lot of time and effort to clean up after using air fryer. High effectively keeps your air fryer free from grease, food residue, and grime. Say goodbye to the hassle of scrubbing down your air fryer basket BETTER THAN THE PAPER LINERS: Silicone air fryer liner are reusable, durable and eco-friendly. These liners are a perfect replacement for flammable parchment paper. No longer have to cut or shape parchment paper to fit in the air fryer. Saving money on parchment paper and cutting down on waste. Easy to clean and work so much better than the disposable paper liners. High-quality silicone liners are sturdy and the even have handles for ease of lifting them from the fryer. SAFE FOOD GRADE & HEAT RESISTANT SILICONE: Our Silicone Air Fryer Liners Inserts are made of safe food-grade silicone, non-stick, bpa free, colorfast, heat resistant up to 464℉ (240℃). You can season the food in the liner, cook in the liner and even use the liner as a server plate. The liner does a great job of preventing food from sticking or tearing, which is especially important when cooking delicate items like salmon. OIL DRAINING DESIGN & WIDE APPLICATION: Silicone air fryer liners comes with a unique groove design, improves air circulation and heat distribution to cook your food in less time, makes residual oil or grease easy to flow out, enjoy healthier food. suitable for toaster, steamer, oven, instant pot and microwave, etc. Help to make foods like bacon, turkey, cookies, and bread...Perfect gift for Mother's Day, holidays and birthdays.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61GpjQfU4ML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TKISZYZR","source_asin":"B0BL3HX84B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-547973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL3HX84B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL3HX84B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
